 Operate machines and perform routine tasks to prepare canned and frozen fruit and vegetables, and make and package sauces, jams and juices and different product of fruits and vegetables.', 600, 600, '401–600', 'Version', '03 May 2023', '04 May 2026', 'West Bengal State Council of Technical & Vocational Education and Skill Development (WBSCTVESD)', 'West Bengal State Council of Technical & Vocational Education and Skill Development, Karigari Bhavan (5th Floor), Plot-B/7, Action Area-III
