poultry farm. The individual ensures proper care of the poultry birds, their health and productivity, meat
and/or egg production and marketing of the produce', 210, 210, '201–400', 'Version', '29 Sep 2023', '29 Sep 2026', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India
