and fish keeping which is aesthetically pleasing and sound for the fish and customers', 390, 390, '201–400', 'Version', '08 May 2025', '08 May 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Aquaculture Workers', 'Aquarium Technician (L4), Senior Aquarium Technician (L5)', 'Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"90","Practical":"120","EmployabilitySkills":"90","OJT_Mandatory":"90"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "167", "qualification_type": "Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-05-AG-03911-2025-V2-ASCI', 'Dairy Farm Supervisor', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 5.0, 'A Dairy Farm Supervisor plans, coordinates and manages the day-to-day operations of a dairy farm. The 
Individual is responsible for milk production, health and well-being of the farm animals and also personnel 
management. The Individual is responsible for implementing the short and long-term business plans of the  farm owner. On larger farms, a farm supervisor is also responsible for recruiting and managing staff.', 480, 480, '401–600', 'Version', '06 Jun 2025', '30 Apr 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Livestock and Dairy Producers', 'Dairy Farm Manager (L6)', 'Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"100","Practical":"170","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"150"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "168", "qualification_type": "Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-03-AG-04182-2025-V2-ASCI', 'Paddy Cultivator', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 3.0, 'The job of a paddy cultivator involves cultivation of paddy as per the package of practices 
recommended for a particular agronomic climate zone, type of soil, rainfall pattern and climatic 
conditions to achieve the yields as per the genetic potential of a given variety and sell the produce 
as per the competitive market prices without distress sale.', 270, 270, '201–400', 'Version', '08 May 2025', '08 May 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Paddy Farmer', 'Organic Grower (L4)', 'Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"90","Practical":"150","EmployabilitySkills":"30","OJT_Mandatory":"0"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "169", "qualification_type": "Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-04-AG-03923-2025-V2-ASCI', 'Barefoot Technician', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 4.0, 'A Barefoot Technician works as a technical assistant and performs various tasks under the instructions and 
guidance of the Technical Assistant (TA)/Junior Engineer (JE)/ Assistant Engineer (AE), such as assisting in 
identification of work and worksites under Mahatma Gandhi National Rural Employment Guarantee Act 
(MGNREGA); collecting baseline information; assisting in making the presentation to Gram Panchayat (GP) 
and preparing work register; assisting in preparing for work on the MGNREGA worksite; assisting in preparing 
for work on the MGNREGA work site; supervising work at MGNREGA worksites and maintaining the relevant 
MGNREGA records.', 390, 390, '201–400', 'Version', '08 May 2025', '30 Apr 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Bare Foot Technician (BFT)', 'Barefoot Technician (L4), Barefoot supervisor (L5)', 'Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"90","Practical":"120","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"120"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "170", "qualification_type": "Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-04-AG-03913-2025-V2-ASCI', 'Milk Collection Center In charge', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 4.0, 'A Milk Collection Centre in charge is responsible for first-level milk collection & testing. The 
individual ensures the milk is stored in a safe environment that avoids spoilage. The individual 
should be competent enough in clean milk production, hygienic milk handling and ensuring milk 
safety', 390, 390, '201–400', 'Version', '06 Jun 2025', '30 Apr 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Livestock and Dairy Producers', 'Milk Procurement & Input Supervisor(L5)', 'Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"90","Practical":"120","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"120"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "171", "qualification_type": "Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-04-AG-03924-2025-V2-ASCI', 'Community Service Provider', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 4.0, 'A Community Service Provider also known as Village Level Entrepreneur (VLE) provides a variety of 
Government to Citizen (G2C) and Business to Consumer (B2C) services. The individual sets up a Common 
Service Centre (CSC) in the selected rural/ semi-rural/ urban areas for the purpose and also assists farmers in 
subscribing to and availing relevant government schemes and benefits respectively. Through the CSC, 
the person sells relevant products and services offered by corporates and the government.', 390, 390, '201–400', 'Version', '08 May 2025', '30 Apr 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Community Service Provider', 'Community Service Provider (L4), Agri service input dealer (L5)', 'Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"90","Practical":"120","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"120"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "172", "qualification_type": "Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-05-AG-03915-2025-V2-ASCI', 'Poultry feed, food safety and labelling Supervisor', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 5.0, 'A Poultry feed, food Safety and labeling Supervisor is responsible for ensuring that the feed and feed 
ingredients for poultry is safe for consumption and also the food produced on the poultry farm is safe to eat 
and properly labeled according to relevant laws and regulations.', 480, 480, '401–600', 'Version', '06 Jun 2025', '30 Apr 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Poultry Producers', 'Poultry farm Manager (Level 6)', 'Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"200","Practical":"100","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"120"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "173", "qualification_type": "Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-05-AG-03912-2025-V2-ASCI', 'Milk Procurement & Input Supervisor', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 5.0, 'A Milk Procurement & Input Supervisor is responsible for supporting Dairy Cooperative Societies (DCS)/Producer Institutions (PI) as a sustainable unit along with optimization of transportation cost of milk tankers/trucks. The individual also ensures that the shortest transportation routes are put in use so that milk reaches the dairy plant in the shortest possible time to preserve the quality of milk.', 480, 480, '401–600', 'Version', '06 Jun 2025', '30 Apr 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Dairy and Livestock Producers, Other', 'Dairy Farm Manager(L6)', 'Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"120","Practical":"180","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"120"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "174", "qualification_type": "Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-05-AG-03916-2025-V2-ASCI', 'Poultry Farm Supervisor', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 5.0, 'The poultry farm supervisor supervises, and coordinates activities of workers engaged in raising 
poultry, collecting eggs and maintaining equipment and facilities on poultry farm. The person 
confers with farm manager to ascertain the production requirements and to discuss the supplies 
and maintenance of equipment.', 480, 570, '401–600', 'Version', '06 Jun 2025', '30 Apr 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Farmer, Poultry/Broiler Farm Supervisor', 'Poultry farm manager (L6)', 'Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"135","Practical":"195","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"90"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "175", "qualification_type": "Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-05-AG-04288-2025-V1-CUTM', 'Advanced Farm Equipment Supervisor', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 5.0, 'The supervisor is responsible to supervise advanced farm machinery operation based on the standard operating procedure, supervise GPS-guided machinery and automated systems. He also monitor crop health and environmental conditions using sensors, adjust farming practices based on data analytics and remote sensing and conduct routine maintenance and ensure equipment safety.', 540, 540, '401–600', 'Version', '08 May 2025', '08 May 2028', 'Centurion University of Technology and Management (CUTM)', 'Centurion University of Technology and Management', 'Farm Machinery Operators, Other', 'Manager – Advanced Farming', 'General Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"160","Practical":"260","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"60"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "176", "qualification_type": "General Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-05-AG-04289-2025-V1-CUTM', 'Dairy Processing And Development Supervisor', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 5.0, 'The Individual is able to understand the technologies of raw milk processing operations, get hands-on experience to prepare different dairy products, microbiological analysis and role of dairy starters in manufacturing fermented dairy products, monitor safety and analyze chemical quality of milk and milk products.', 570, 570, '401–600', 'Version', '08 May 2025', '08 May 2028', 'Centurion University of Technology and Management (CUTM)', 'Centurion University of Technology and Management', 'Dairy Products Makers, Others', 'Dairy Plant Manager', 'General Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"160","Practical":"290","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"60"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "177", "qualification_type": "General Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-05-AG-04287-2025-V1-CUTM', 'Smart Farming Supervisor', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 5.0, 'The individual manages the crop in the farm using smart tools and latest technology. He or she is responsible to understand field variability using IoT based sensors and UAV. Further, he should devise appropriate strategies to manage the identified variability precisely, synchronizing to the crop demand.', 660, 660, '601–800', 'Version', '08 May 2025', '08 May 2028', 'Centurion University of Technology and Management (CUTM)', 'Centurion University of Technology and Management', 'Farm Machinery Operators, Other', 'Smart Farming Manager', 'Future Skills Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"180","Practical":"300","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"120"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "178", "qualification_type": "Future Skills Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-05-AG-04286-2025-V1-CUTM', 'Soil and Water Conservation Supervisor', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 5.0, 'The individual will get detailed insights on watershed processes and hydro-climatic data processing technique, scientific methodology of maintaining data records, maintenance of equipment, design consideration of different soil and water conservation structures for minimizing soil erosion and improving crop production.', 630, 630, '601–800', 'Version', '08 May 2025', '08 May 2028', 'Centurion University of Technology and Management (CUTM)', 'Centurion University of Technology and Management', 'Soil Conservationist', 'Watershed Manager', 'General Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"190","Practical":"320","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"60"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "179", "qualification_type": "General Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-05-AG-04290-2025-V1-CUTM', 'Intensive Aquaculture Supervisor', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 5.0, 'The supervisor is responsible for various farming system which involve pond culture, polythene line pond, raceways, in pond raceway system, cage and pen culture etc. it gives practical exposure about design, layout, standard operating procedures, water quality management, feed management, health management, species selection.', 540, 540, '401–600', 'Version', '08 May 2025', '08 May 2028', 'Centurion University of Technology and Management (CUTM)', 'Centurion University of Technology and Management', 'Aquaculture', 'Manager Aquaculture', 'General Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"160","Practical":"260","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"60"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "180", "qualification_type": "General Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('NG-04-AG-04420-2025-V1-ASCI', 'Essentials of Tea sommelier', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 4.0, 'This OS unit covers the competencies required to manage and enhance the overall tea 
experience for customers. It involves selecting and sourcing premium teas, curating tea 
menus, and applying appropriate brewing techniques to achieve optimal flavour and 
quality. It also includes conducting tea tastings, educating customers and staff on tea 
varieties, origins, and food pairings, as well as recommending teas to complement 
different cuisines. Also maintaining tea quality standards, tea blending, and promoting 
tea culture through customer engagement ensuring a highquality and memorable tea 
service', 60, 60, '1–200', 'Version', '29 Sep 2025', '29 Sep 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Food and Beverage Tasters and Graders, Other', 'NIL', 'General Qualification,National Occupational Standard,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"23","Practical":"37","EmployabilitySkills":"0","OJT_Mandatory":"0"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "181", "qualification_type": "General Qualification,National Occupational Standard,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('NG-04-AG-04421-2025-V1-ASCI', 'Fundamentals of Tea Tasting', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 4.0, 'This OS unit describes the role and expertise of a tea taster, focusing on how a trained professional examines and evaluates the quality of tea. It outlines how trainees develop the ability to detect subtle variations in flavor, aroma, and appearance, and apply this knowledge to determine the tea market readiness or potential for blending.', 210, 210, '201–400', 'Version', '29 Sep 2025', '29 Sep 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Tea Taster', 'NIL', 'General Qualification,National Occupational Standard,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"35","Practical":"175","EmployabilitySkills":"0","OJT_Mandatory":"0"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "182", "qualification_type": "General Qualification,National Occupational Standard,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-04-AG-04460-2025-V1-ASCI', 'Zoo Animal Keeper-Small Captive Animals', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 4.0, 'A  Zoo Animal Keeper -Small Captive Animals is responsible for the daily care, management, and well-being of small captive animals and their habitats. The role involves feeding the animals, cleaning and maintaining their enclosures, and monitoring their health, eating patterns, and behavior on a regular basis. The keeper is also responsible for grooming, bathing, and ensuring the animals receive adequate exercise to remain healthy and active, while always prioritizing personal and animal safety. Additionally, the keeper supports veterinarians in health checks, treatments, and medical care.', 480, 480, '401–600', 'Version', '07 Oct 2025', '07 Oct 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Animal Keeper', 'Zoo Animal Keeper- Large Captive animals (L5)', 'Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"155","Practical":"175","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"90"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "183", "qualification_type": "Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-04-AG-04461-2025-V1-ASCI', 'Interior Landscaper', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 4.0, 'An Interior Landscaper is responsible for designing, setting up and maintaining interior gardens. The 
individual also installs and maintains various garden features to create visual appeal in interior 
spaces.', 390, 390, '201–400', 'Version', '07 Oct 2025', '07 Oct 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Gardeners, Horticultural and Nursery Growers', 'Landscape Supervisor (L5)', 'Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"90","Practical":"180","EmployabilitySkills":"90","OJT_Mandatory":"30"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "184", "qualification_type": "Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('QG-03-AG-04676-2025-V2-ASCI', 'Krishi Sahayak', 'agriculture', 'Agriculture', 3.0, 'Krishi Sahayak is popularly known as Krishi Sakhi or Aajeevika Krishi Mitra (AKM) or Community Resource Person-Agriculture. The individual is responsible for creating awareness and building capacity of farmer/ rural house hold members on agricultural activities and facilitates aggregation and marketing of the agricultural produce for sustainable agriculture-based livelihoods at SHGs/household level. The individual in job is also required to collect various data of each individual farmer/ producer member on various parameter. The individual also provides technical guidance to farmers on various crop cultivation practices and demonstrate improved practices for the same.', 300, 300, '201–400', 'Version', '20 Nov 2025', '20 Nov 2028', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India (ASCI)', 'Agriculture Skill Council of India', 'Agriculture Extension Service provider', 'Agriculture Extension Service Provider (L4)', 'Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"125","Practical":"145","EmployabilitySkills":"30","OJT_Mandatory":"0"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "185", "qualification_type": "Apprenticeship Qualification,General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_04.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
INSERT INTO nsqf_qualifications (q_code, title, sector_id, sector_name, nsqf_level, description, min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range, version, originally_approved, valid_till, awarding_body, certifying_bodies, proposed_occupation, progression_pathway, qualification_type, adopted_qualification, training_delivery_hours, is_pwd, pwd_categories, raw_metadata, source_file, is_active) VALUES ('NG-2.5-AP-00739-2023-V1-AMHSSC', 'Tailor (Darzi)', 'apparel', 'Apparel', 2.5, 'Darzi is a skilled tailor versed with making customized various types of dresses. The job thus involves taking measurement, cutting fabric as per measurement and sewing with the help of ordinary sewing machines. The person also does alteration works of stitched dress materials to correct and fit as per customer requirements. Further with PM Vishwakarma scheme the aim is to achieve Up gradation of Vishwakarmas to power tools for Darzi and to provide support to enhance the capacity, productivity and quality of products.', 40, 40, '1–200', 'Version', '14 Sep 2023', '14 Sep 2026', 'Apparel, Madeups & HomeFurnishing Sector Skill Council (AMHSSC)', 'Apparel, Madeups & HomeFurnishing Sector Skill Council (AMHSSC)', '- - -', '- - -', 'National Occupational Standard', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"10.5","Practical":"29.5","EmployabilitySkills":"0","OJT_Mandatory":"0"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "1", "qualification_type": "National Occupational Standard", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_00_12.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
