responsible for setting up test equipment, troubleshooting components of instruments, calibrating them
and also preparing service reports, documenting the repair and replacement of parts.', 450, 450, '401–600', 'Version', '30 Apr 2025', '30 Apr 2028', 'Capital Goods and Strategic Skill Council (CGSSC)', 'Capital Goods and Strategic Skills Council', 'Calibration and Instrumentation', 'Predictive Maintenance Engineer L5.5,
Predictive data acquisition engineer L6', 'General Qualification,Multi-Skill Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"150","Practical":"210","EmployabilitySkills":"30","OJT_Mandatory":"60"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "93", "qualification_type": "General Qualification,Multi-Skill Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_01_56.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
