mechanical equipment and components. The individual selects and uses the appropriate Computer-Aided Design (CAD) software and equipment for the purpose, depending on the type and complexity of the drawing functions to be carried out. The person collaborates with engineers, production technicians and clients to identify design problems and develop effective solutions.', 450, 450, '401–600', 'Version', '30 Apr 2025', '30 Apr 2028', 'Capital Goods and Strategic Skill Council (CGSSC)', 'Capital Goods and Strategic Skills Council', 'Design', 'Designer Mechanical - 5, 
Computer aided tool and die design engineer -6', 'General Qualification,Multi-Skill Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"120","Practical":"240","EmployabilitySkills":"30","OJT_Mandatory":"60"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "97", "qualification_type": "General Qualification,Multi-Skill Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_01_56.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
