structure/component/product as per work requirements. The individual also performs quality checks and
ensures correct installation of the fabricated structure at the worksite, as per required standards.', 570, 570, '401–600', 'Version', '30 Apr 2025', '30 Apr 2028', 'Capital Goods and Strategic Skill Council (CGSSC)', 'Capital Goods and Strategic Skills Council', 'Fabrication, Fitting and Assembly', 'Metal Fabrication Engineer L6', 'General Qualification,Multi-Skill Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"130","Practical":"320","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"60"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "105", "qualification_type": "General Qualification,Multi-Skill Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_01_56.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
