building or repairing associated structures in accordance with the construction plans. There is a
direct relationship between the nature and quality of the product required and the payment made
by the customer. Therefore, the bricklayer has a continuing responsibility to work professionally in
order to meet the requirements of the customer and thus maintain and grow the business. This
includes working harmoniously with other trades in order to optimize efficiency and minimize
mistakes.', 510, 510, '401–600', 'Version', '06 Feb 2024', '06 Feb 2026', 'Construction Skill Development Council of India (CSDCI)', 'Construction Skill Development Council of India', 'Skill Competitions', 'N/A', 'General Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"150","Practical":"360","EmployabilitySkills":"00","OJT_Mandatory":"00"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "33", "qualification_type": "General Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_02_11.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
