Youth can become wage employed/ self-employed with the skill set of Bio Gas Plant construction, maintenance and bio slurry production.', 450, 450, '401–600', 'Version', '14 Dec 2023', '11 Dec 2026', 'West Bengal State Council of Technical & Vocational Education and Skill Development (WBSCTVESD)', 'West Bengal State Council of Technical & Vocational Education and Skill Development, Karigari Bhavan (5th Floor), Plot-B/7, Action Area-III
New Town, Kolkata-700160', 'Bio Gas Plant & Bio Slurry Technician', 'Horizontal Progression: 

1.Vermi-Composter (L-3)
2.Mushroom Cultivator (L-3) 

Vertical Progression: 
1.  Sr. Bio Gas Plant Technician (L-4) to be developed 
2. Bio Gas Plant Manager (L-5)', 'General Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"90","Practical":"240","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"60"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "26", "qualification_type": "General Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_05_50.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
