He/She would be responsible for developing a business plan, hiring the human resources, acquiring financial and material resources, providing leadership, and their vision drives the company''s strategy.', 450, 540, '401–600', 'Version', '31 Aug 2023', '30 Aug 2026', 'Skill Council for Green Jobs (SCGJ)', 'Skill Council for Green Jobs
