Trainees will develop an understanding of interpreting equipment datasheets and drawings like piping and instrumentation and accordingly will be responsible for incorporating critical design and engineering aspects vital for guaranteeing the safe operation of green hydrogen production facilities.', 30, 30, '1–200', 'Version', '15 Apr 2024', '15 Mar 2027', 'Skill Council for Green Jobs (SCGJ)', 'Skill Council for Green Jobs
