The course on (I) Value Addition & Marketing of Non-Timber Forest Products (NTFPs)- (Animal Origin): Wild Beekeeping & processing. A Beekeeper is responsible for carrying out beekeeping operations which include preparing for and setting up beehives; procuring and introducing bees in hives, and maintaining the bees and beehives. The individual is also responsible for harvesting, processing and marketing honey and related produce.', 240, 240, '201–400', 'Version', '31 Jan 2024', '31 Jan 2027', 'Skill Council for Green Jobs (SCGJ)', 'Skill Council for Green Jobs
Chief Executive Officer
