New Town, Kolkata-700160', 'Toy Maker (Soft Toys)', 'Horizontal Progression:
1.	Assistant Wooden Toy Maker   L-3
2.	Assistant Glass Toy Maker-Artisan   L-3
3.	Traditional Soft Toy Maker    L-3
4.	Creative Leather Toy Maker (Advance)   L-3
5.	Creative Soft Toy Maker (Advance)    L-3
Vertical Progression:
1. Leather Toy Maker (Artisan)    L-4
2. Wooden Toy Maker -Artisan    L-4
3. Micro Entrepreneur   Toy making    (To be developed)   L-4', 'General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"120","Practical":"150","EmployabilitySkills":"00","OJT_Mandatory":"120"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "71", "qualification_type": "General Qualification,Upskilling Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_06_27.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
