The individual will be responsible for nutrition, health, hygiene, economics, rural development, child development, sociology and family relations, community living, art, food, clothing, textiles, and home management to bring everyday life in sync with the changing surroundings.', 570, 690, '601–800', 'Version', '29 Sep 2022', '29 Sep 2026', 'Home Management and Care Givers Sector Skill Counil (HMCGSSC)', 'Domestic Workers Sector Skills Council of India', 'Housekeeping', 'Estate Manager', 'General Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"220","Practical":"290","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"0"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "1", "qualification_type": "General Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_06_44.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
