●	Can start their own Small-Scale business and can be self employed', 360, 360, '201–400', 'Version', '25 Aug 2022', '25 Aug 2025', 'National Institute of Electronics and Information Technology (NIELIT)', 'National Institute of Electronics and Information Technology NIELIT Bhawan, Plot No.3, PSP Pocket, Sector-8, Dwarka, New Delhi-110077', 'Office Assistant, Desktop Publisher, Account Assistant, Technical Assistant.
