can apply for Data Entry for Software Execution roles and also perform
Noting & Drafting Assistance,
EDP Assistance', 210, 210, '201–400', 'Version', '25 Aug 2022', '25 Aug 2025', 'National Institute of Electronics and Information Technology (NIELIT)', 'National Institute of Electronics and Information Technology NIELIT Bhawan, PSP Pocket, Plot No. 3, Sector 8, Dwarka, New Delhi - 110077', 'Data Entry Operator, Technical Assistant, Computer Operator', 'Professional Progression:
