Produce evidence for employment: Demonstrate solutions through AI projects capturing industrial or Social impact.', 570, 570, '401–600', 'Version', '31 Jan 2023', '31 Jan 2026', 'National Institute of Electronics and Information Technology (NIELIT)', 'NIELIT Bhawan, Plot No. 3, PSP Pocket, Sector-8, Dwarka, NEW Delhi- 110077', 'AI Development', 'Academic:
