You will learn how to personalize your instance, favorite a filtered list, create and comment on a record, create a visual task board from a List, order an Item from service catalog, create a dashboard and a report, flag, and Comment on knowledge articles. This course will also increase your ability to navigate proficiently within the ServiceNow Platform.', 24, 24, '1–200', 'Version', '03 May 2023', '03 May 2026', 'IT-ITeS Sector Skills Council NASSCOM (SSC NASSCOM)', 'IT-ITeS SSC NASSCOM', 'Cloud Computing', 'N/A', 'OEM Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"12","Practical":"12","EmployabilitySkills":"0","OJT_Mandatory":"0"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "31", "qualification_type": "OEM Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_07_27.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
