analyzing data related to the performance of machinery and equipment in Capital Goods industries', 660, 660, '601–800', 'Version', '08 May 2025', '08 May 2028', 'Capital Goods and Strategic Skill Council (CGSSC)', 'Capital Goods and Strategic Skills Council', 'Maintenance', 'Predictive Maintenance Head (Level-6.5)
