joinery skills – including how to make scale drawings, how to measure and cut pieces of wood and techniques for joining wooden components. The individual should possess basic literacy and numeracy skills and be able to communicate effectively with the set construction team.', 330, 330, '201–400', 'Version', '27 Jan 2022', '25 Jan 2027', 'Media & Entertainment Skill Council (MESC)', 'MESC – Media & Entertainment Skill Council', 'SET CARPENTER', 'Set Decorator', 'General Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"95","Practical":"175","EmployabilitySkills":"00","OJT_Mandatory":"60"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "39", "qualification_type": "General Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_09_21.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
