Desk editors are responsible for the news stories covered by their media outlets. Desk editors must be capable of multitasking, assessing news tips, and making quick decisions when breaking news is reported to ensure that their news outlet provides the best possible coverage.', 840, 840, '801–1000', 'Version', '31 Mar 2022', '30 Mar 2027', 'Media & Entertainment Skill Council (MESC)', 'MESC – Media & Entertainment Skill Council', 'Journalism', 'Level 6 (Vertical)
Editor-in-Chief / News Editor', 'General Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"330","Practical":"450","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"0"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "75", "qualification_type": "General Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_09_21.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
