functions in the supply chain. S/He will analyse and create SOPs to be followed for sustainability. The
supply chain sustainability specialist will ensure the successful implementation of these processes with
measurable results.', 600, 600, '401–600', 'Version', '15 Mar 2024', '15 Mar 2027', 'Logistics Sector Skill Council (LSC)', 'Logistics sector skill council', 'Sustainability', 'Senior Sustainability Specialist', 'Future Skills Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"125","Practical":"325","EmployabilitySkills":"90","OJT_Mandatory":"60"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "48", "qualification_type": "Future Skills Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_15_31.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
