movement at terminals. S/he plans and supervises the repair and maintenance of containers using ERP
while overseeing operations, complying with regulations and general cleanliness within a port terminal.', 570, 630, '601–800', 'Version', '30 May 2024', '30 May 2027', 'Logistics Sector Skill Council (LSC)', 'Logistics sector skill council', 'Port Operations Coordination', 'Port Terminals Manager', 'Future Skills Qualification', 'N.A.', '{"Theory":"200","Practical":"280","EmployabilitySkills":"60","OJT_Mandatory":"30"}', false, '{}'::text[], '{"source_row": "52", "qualification_type": "Future Skills Qualification", "version": "Version"}'::jsonb, 'Qualifications 02-10-2026 20_15_31.xlsx', true) ON CONFLICT (q_code, title) DO UPDATE SET sector_id = EXCLUDED.sector_id, nsqf_level = EXCLUDED.nsqf_level, description = EXCLUDED.description, min_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.min_notional_hours, max_notional_hours = EXCLUDED.max_notional_hours, notional_hours_range = EXCLUDED.notional_hours_range, is_pwd = EXCLUDED.is_pwd, pwd_categories = EXCLUDED.pwd_categories, updated_at = NOW();
